{"id": 7043, "doi": "10.4038/slja.v23i1.7043", "title": "Use of Ayer\u2019s T piece circuit for monitored anaesthesia care for ERCP", "abstract": "<p>Although moderate (conscious) sedation is intended during elective gastrointestinal endoscopy, unintended levels of deep sedation occur resulting in respiratory and cardiac compromise. We present here use of Ayre\u2019s T-piece circuit along with nasopharyngeal airway for Endoscopic Retrograde CholangioPancreatography (ERCP) procedure under sedation which negates all the above problems, ensuring safety of the patient.</p><p>DOI: <a href=\"http://dx.doi.org/10.4038/slja.v23i1.7043\">http://dx.doi.org/10.4038/slja.v23i1.7043</a></p><p>\u00a0</p> <p><strong> </strong></p>", "keywords": ["conscious sedation", "endoscopic retrograde cholangiopancreatography", "monitoring", "Ayre's T-piece circuit"], "authors": [{"first_name": "Sumit", "last_name": "Bhargava", "institution": "", "country": "IN", "email": "sumit_bhargava782000@yahoo.com", "orcid": ""}, {"first_name": "Nupur", "last_name": "Chakravarty", "institution": "", "country": "IN", "email": "", "orcid": ""}, {"first_name": "Seema", "last_name": "Shende", "institution": "", "country": "IN", "email": "", "orcid": ""}, {"first_name": "Rajendra Prasad", "last_name": "Patel", "institution": "", "country": "IN", "email": "", "orcid": ""}, {"first_name": "Ramchandra Vinayak", "last_name": "Shidhaye", "institution": "", "country": "IN", "email": "", "orcid": ""}], "section": "Case Reports", "pages": "22-23", "date_published": "2015-01-09T11:38:27+00:00", "date_submitted": "2014-06-23T23:30:49+00:00", "license_name": "", "license_link": "", "files": [{"label": "PDF", "language": "en", "url": "https://slja.sljol.info/articles/7043/files/7043-1-27192-1-10-20141130.pdf"}], "references": "", "volume": 23, "number": "1", "year": 2015, "issue_id": 730}